# Vercel monorepo deploys — client + api ship from the same project, so
# the client makes SAME-ORIGIN requests. Leaving VITE_API_URL empty
# means apiUrl('/api/auth/login') resolves to '/api/auth/login', which
# Vercel's vercel.json rewrite forwards to the api/index.js serverless
# function. No CORS, no mixed content, no cross-domain DNS lookups.
#
# If you ever split client + api onto different hosts (e.g. Railway
# for api, Vercel for static), set this to the api's https URL here.
VITE_API_URL=
